{"id": "68789", "title": "渣婚之后", "author": "欣欣向荣", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68789.htm", "intro": "方振东第一次见到寒引素，\r\n\r\n是在军总后面的小花园里，\r\n\r\n那时候她穿着白色的羽绒服，\r\n\r\n惨白的小脸，乌黑的头发，\r\n\r\n越发显得眉眼分明，\r\n\r\n从此就仿佛刻在他脑子里一样......\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 天之骄子 情有独钟", "base": "files/article/html/68/68789", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10545825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10545826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10545827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10545828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10545829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10545830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10545831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10545832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10545833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-51", "file": "10545834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-57", "file": "10545835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-63完结", "file": "10545836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "10545837.html", "available": false}]}